# The repository root .gitignore carries a blanket
#
#     *.html
#     !docs/**/*.html
#
# added to stop scraped research pages being swept into a commit. It also
# excludes THIS TOOL'S OWN PAGE, which is the file Playwright loads and
# without which the renderer does not run at all. A deeper .gitignore wins, so
# re-include it here. (The rule that a re-include cannot work applies to files
# under an excluded DIRECTORY; `*.html` excludes files, so this is allowed.)
#
# This was not theoretical: commit b9608f2 committed v2/tools/render/ without
# index.html for exactly this reason.
!index.html
